/*
  ChargingTab.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0054 · ChargingTab (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `ChargingTab` resolves (table "ChargingTab") lives here with its web English value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own
  strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group holds the keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/analytics/components/analytics/ChargingTab.tsx) — the canonical
  `analytics.charging.*` namespace. The remaining keys back the native-only chrome
  (freshness chip, stale/offline banner, loading / error / retry copy, and the VoiceOver
  value nouns). The "kWh", "kW" and "%" card subtitles are unit symbols rendered verbatim
  (web string literals), not translatable copy, matching how the sibling charts treat
  "Wh/km".
*/

